  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这款超轻量级材质包专为注重格调、喝咖啡时翘起小指的审美达人设计。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">虽然材质包只包含一个纹理，但你绝对想象不到它能给游戏世界带来多大的改变！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果那些令人不适的圆形阴影也让你感到刺眼，那么这个材质包就是为你准备的！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/299/405/authentic-shadows.png\" width=\"427\" height=\"766\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">同样推荐：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/misty-world\" rel=\"nofollow\">雾隐世界</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/saltymod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">咸味模组</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/masonry-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">砖石方块</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">还有我的新游戏：<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.liahim85.puzzle26\" rel=\"nofollow\">26-拼图</a> ！！！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/liahim\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://images.macrumors.com/t/mqZEotb5TSHKUv-i6SKmZrnbpFQ=/1600x0/article-new/2025/05/patreon.jpg\" width=\"250\" height=\"140\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3128\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b589f79a1e59fb2cc2b4e5cd31e9941a33b69746_0.webp\" width=\"900\" height=\"141\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
